# Current-main's TOKEN_BINDING_DENY_CORPUS pins this file to a naranjo
# identity carrying lidersea's Secret. Only the own-instance binding may deny it.
Pod cloudflare-public/naranjo-connector-with-lidersea-token-env may take its Tunnel token only from the Secret derived from its own app.kubernetes.io/instance, through env.valueFrom.secretKeyRef and never through envFrom
